{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41737290",
      "title": "Adding Static Metadata",
      "sourceHash": "6d1282a56071960eccc6507548186a68794a749ff41ac237bed253fc96656cfc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.6,
          "end": 3.9,
          "en": "All that, we are now finally pretty much done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.9,
          "end": 6.78,
          "en": "with this application here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.78,
          "end": 9.39,
          "en": "Now I will quickly fix a styling error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.39,
          "end": 13.02,
          "en": "which I only just detected, which has been fixed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.02,
          "end": 15.72,
          "en": "in the attachments I provided to you though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.72,
          "end": 19.26,
          "en": "so you already got the right styles earlier, but here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.26,
          "end": 20.34,
          "en": "I'll fix it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.34,
          "end": 24.87,
          "en": "by moving position relative in the meal-item.module CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.87,
          "end": 28.35,
          "en": "from this meal header selector to the image selector.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.35,
          "end": 31.14,
          "en": "Again, I did already fix that in the attachments",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.14,
          "end": 34.23,
          "en": "I provided to you, so you don't have to do anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.23,
          "end": 37.32,
          "en": "and you got the right styles all the time already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.32,
          "end": 41.01,
          "en": "But now here for me, those meals also look a bit better,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.01,
          "end": 43.17,
          "en": "but that's just one thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.17,
          "end": 46.29,
          "en": "The more important last step I want to go through",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.29,
          "end": 49.56,
          "en": "together with you is the page metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.56,
          "end": 52.26,
          "en": "that you can add to your pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.26,
          "end": 56.13,
          "en": "And you can see that in the root layout.JS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.13,
          "end": 58.59,
          "en": "there we have a metadata constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.59,
          "end": 63.39,
          "en": "that's being exported and that's not some random constant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.39,
          "end": 68.25,
          "en": "but instead, NextJS is looking for exported variables",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.25,
          "end": 70.35,
          "en": "or constants called metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.35,
          "end": 73.68,
          "en": "in all your page or layout files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.68,
          "end": 75.96000000000001,
          "en": "And then in this metadata object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.96000000000001,
          "end": 79.2,
          "en": "you can set some metadata fields,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.2,
          "end": 82.98,
          "en": "which is also described in the official documentation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.98,
          "end": 86.4,
          "en": "There, you can find details about all the fields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.4,
          "end": 88.98,
          "en": "you can set on this metadata object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.98,
          "end": 92.64,
          "en": "and attached you find a link to this documentation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.64,
          "end": 94.65,
          "en": "so that you can explore in depth",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.65,
          "end": 96.453,
          "en": "which fields can be set there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.5,
          "end": 100.74000000000001,
          "en": "In short, this metadata constant allows you to add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.74000000000001,
          "end": 103.47,
          "en": "a bunch of metadata, which is then, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.47,
          "end": 106.28999999999999,
          "en": "exposed to search engine crawlers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.28999999999999,
          "end": 110.1,
          "en": "or which shows up when you are sharing a link to a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.1,
          "end": 112.503,
          "en": "on X or Facebook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.52000000000001,
          "end": 115.32,
          "en": "Now here, I'll keep it fairly simple,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.32,
          "end": 119.193,
          "en": "but I wanna add a title and description to every page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.06,
          "end": 122.49,
          "en": "Now, if you add this metadata to a layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.49,
          "end": 125.43,
          "en": "it will automatically be added to all the pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.43,
          "end": 127.5,
          "en": "that are wrapped by that layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.5,
          "end": 131.34,
          "en": "unless a page specifies its own metadata.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.34,
          "end": 133.683,
          "en": "In that case, the page metadata wins.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.55,
          "end": 137.55,
          "en": "Any nested layout metadata would also win",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.55,
          "end": 139.773,
          "en": "over that root layout metadata,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.79,
          "end": 142.62,
          "en": "but by setting this metadata here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.62,
          "end": 146.13,
          "en": "every page will at least have this basic metadata.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.13,
          "end": 149.07,
          "en": "But now of course, I wanna set more specific metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.07,
          "end": 151.47,
          "en": "for sum of my pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.47,
          "end": 154.383,
          "en": "For example, for that all meals page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.34,
          "end": 158.46,
          "en": "There, it would be nice to have some metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.46,
          "end": 161.34,
          "en": "and we can therefore add it by simply exporting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.34,
          "end": 163.803,
          "en": "this metadata constant there as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.9,
          "end": 169.47,
          "en": "And then here we could set the title to all meals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.47,
          "end": 171.9,
          "en": "and then maybe add a description of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.9,
          "end": 175.56,
          "en": "browse the delicious meals shared",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 175.56,
          "end": 180.56,
          "en": "by our vibrant community, something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.37,
          "end": 186.48,
          "en": "If you do that and you go to that meals page, you'll see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.48,
          "end": 191.48,
          "en": "that if you reload, you have this all meals title here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 192.51,
          "end": 195.72,
          "en": "And if you take a look at the page source,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.72,
          "end": 199.35,
          "en": "you will also find this description meta tag in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 199.35,
          "end": 202.68,
          "en": "which contains your description text as content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 202.68,
          "end": 204.003,
          "en": "Here it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 207.48,
          "end": 209.433,
          "en": "So that's how you can add metadata,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 210.3,
          "end": 214.26,
          "en": "but how can you add metadata to dynamic pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 214.26,
          "end": 216.63,
          "en": "where the title and the description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 216.63,
          "end": 220.77,
          "en": "depends on the concrete data that has been loaded?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 220.77,
          "end": 223.2,
          "en": "Adding static metadata like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 223.2,
          "end": 225.333,
          "en": "typically doesn't do the trick there.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}